   "q_en": "<p>A train with stoppage travels with an average speed of 50km/h. If it stops on an average 20 minutes per hour then find the average speed of the train without stoppage.</p>",
   "q_hi": "<p>&#2309;&#2346;&#2344;&#2375; &#2360;&#2381;&#2335;&#2377;&#2346; &#2346;&#2352; &#2352;&#2369;&#2325;&#2340;&#2375; &#2361;&#2369;&#2319; &#2319;&#2325; &#2335;&#2381;&#2352;&#2375;&#2344; 50km/h &#2325;&#2368; &#2324;&#2360;&#2340; &#2330;&#2366;&#2354; &#2360;&#2375; &#2351;&#2366;&#2340;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &#2351;&#2361; &#2324;&#2360;&#2340;&#2344; 20 &#2350;&#2367;&#2344;&#2335; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367; &#2328;&#2306;&#2335;&#2366; &#2352;&#2369;&#2325;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2360;&#2381;&#2335;&#2377;&#2346; &#2346;&#2352; &#2348;&#2367;&#2344;&#2366; &#2352;&#2369;&#2325;&#2375; &#2335;&#2381;&#2352;&#2375;&#2344; &#2325;&#2368; &#2324;&#2360;&#2340; &#2330;&#2366;&#2354; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p>",
   "options_en": [
    "58 km/h",
    "64 km/h",
    "80 km/h",
    "75 km/h"
   ],
   "options_hi": [
    "58 km/h",
    "64 km/h",
    "80 km/h",
    "75 km/h"
   ],
   "answer": 3,
   "solution_en": "<p>Let the average speed of the train without stoppage = s</p><p>Required time = 20 min/hour</p><p>[(s  -  50)/s] * 60 = 20</p><p>3s  -  150 = s</p><p>2s = 150</p><p>s = 75</p><p>So, the average speed of the train without stoppage = 75 km/h</p>",
   "solution_hi": "<p>Let the average speed of the train without stoppage = s</p><p>Required time = 20 min/hour</p><p>[(s  -  50)/s] * 60 = 20</p><p>3s  -  150 = s</p><p>2s = 150</p><p>s = 75</p><p>So, the average speed of the train without stoppage = 75 km/h</p>",
