   "q_en": "<p>Two trains with a speed of 80 km/h and 120 km/h, respectively, are 500 km apart and face each other. Find the distance between them 10 minutes before crossing.</p>",
   "q_hi": "<p>&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2350;&#2358;&#2307; 80 km/h &#2324;&#2352; 120 km/h &#2325;&#2368; &#2330;&#2366;&#2354; &#2357;&#2366;&#2354;&#2368; &#2342;&#2379; &#2335;&#2381;&#2352;&#2375;&#2344;&#2375;&#2306; 500 km &#2342;&#2370;&#2352; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306; &#2324;&#2352; &#2319;&#2325;-&#2342;&#2370;&#2360;&#2352;&#2375; &#2325;&#2368; &#2323;&#2352; &#2351;&#2366;&#2340;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;&#2404; &#2319;&#2325;-&#2342;&#2370;&#2360;&#2352;&#2375; &#2325;&#2379; &#2346;&#2366;&#2352; &#2325;&#2352;&#2344;&#2375; &#2360;&#2375; 10 &#2350;&#2367;&#2344;&#2335; &#2346;&#2361;&#2354;&#2375; &#2313;&#2344;&#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2368;&#2330; &#2325;&#2368; &#2342;&#2370;&#2352;&#2368; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p>",
   "options_en": [
    "&#8201;72.33 km",
    "&#8201;33.33 km",
    "63.33 km&#8201;",
    "&#8201;52.74 km"
   ],
   "options_hi": [
    "&#8201;72.33 km",
    "&#8201;33.33 km",
    "63.33 km&#8201;",
    "&#8201;52.74 km"
   ],
   "answer": 1,
   "solution_en": "<p>Relative speed of the trains when travelling towards each other = 80 + 120 = 200 km</p><p>Time taken when they meet = 500/200 = 2.5 hours = 150 min</p><p>Sum of distances travelled by the trains 10 minutes before meeting = 200 * (140/60) = 466.67 km</p><p>So, distance between trains 10 minutes before crossing = 500  -  466.67</p><p>= 33.33 km</p>",
