   "q_en": "<p>The lengths of two trains are (X + 30) m and (X + 20) m. They are running on parallel lines in the same direction at a speed of 60 km/hr and 70 km/hr, respectively. If time taken by them to pass each other is 90 sec, then find the value of X.</p>",
   "q_hi": "<p>&#2342;&#2379; &#2335;&#2381;&#2352;&#2375;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2368; &#2354;&#2306;&#2348;&#2366;&#2312; (X + 30) m &#2324;&#2352; (X + 20) m &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2357;&#2375; &#2360;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2342;&#2367;&#2358;&#2366; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2350;&#2358;&#2307; 60 km/hr &#2324;&#2352; 70 km/hr &#2325;&#2368; &#2330;&#2366;&#2354; &#2360;&#2375; &#2360;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344;&#2366;&#2306;&#2340;&#2352; &#2346;&#2335;&#2352;&#2367;&#2351;&#2379;&#2306; &#2346;&#2352; &#2330;&#2354; &#2352;&#2361;&#2375; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;&#2404; &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &#2313;&#2344;&#2325;&#2375; &#2342;&#2381;&#2357;&#2366;&#2352;&#2366; &#2319;&#2325; &#2342;&#2370;&#2360;&#2352;&#2375; &#2325;&#2379; &#2346;&#2366;&#2352; &#2325;&#2352;&#2344;&#2375; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2354;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2327;&#2351;&#2366; &#2360;&#2350;&#2351; 90 &#2360;&#2375;&#2325;&#2306;&#2337; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; X &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p>",
   "options_en": [
    "100",
    "80",
    "120",
    "110"
   ],
   "options_hi": [
    "100",
    "80",
    "120",
    "110"
   ],
   "answer": 0,
   "solution_en": "<p>Total distance to be covered = X + 30 + X + 20 = (2X + 50) m</p><p>Relative speed = 70  -  60 = 10 km/hr = 10 * 5/18 = (25/9) m/sec</p><p>Now,</p><p>2X + 50 = (25/9) * 90</p><p>2X + 50 = 250</p><p>2X = 200</p><p>X = 100</p>",
   "solution_hi": "<p>Total distance to be covered = X + 30 + X + 20 = (2X + 50) m</p><p>Relative speed = 70  -  60 = 10 km/hr = 10 * 5/18 = (25/9) m/sec</p><p>Now,</p><p>2X + 50 = (25/9) * 90</p><p>2X + 50 = 250</p><p>2X = 200</p><p>X = 100</p>",
