   "answer": 1,
   "solution_en": "<p>Let speed and length of the train be 'v' m/s and 'd' m respectively.</p><p>d = 20v</p><p>If the person was running, relative speed = v  -  21.6 * (5/18) = v  -  6</p><p>d = 25(v  -  6)</p><p>20v = 25v  -  150</p><p>5v = 150</p><p>v = 30</p><p>So, d = 20 * 30 = 600 metres</p>",
